    },
    {
      "kind": "narrative",
      "id": "citywide_alert-open-02",
      "speaker": "DALIA",
      "locale": "en-US",
      "text": "Ash Line cells are striking local services while Vanguard pushes the main corridors. These attacks are coordinated. Keep forces on both civic fronts; sending everyone to one fight leaves the other exposed.",
