      "voiceName": "Warline - Engineer Samira Haddad",
      "assetPath": "Assets/Game/Audio/Narrative/CH05M01CitywideAlert/Voice/en/citywide_alert-open-03.wav",
      "durationSeconds": 13.12,
      "sha256": "141d5ab610540ebb4cff3b6224530cb60d17fc08465482e3c85317ad3e52ce11",
      "captionSha256": "45291b339fc659440d6f5ba844b34b29c44a5478e0795d745297919ca2eebc9a"
    },
    {
      "deliveryProfile": "fa-conversational-v1",
      "voiceSettings": {
        "stability": 0.5,
        "similarity_boost": 0.75
      },
      "performanceDirection": "[conversational tone]",
      "kind": "narrative",
      "id": "citywide_alert-open-03",
      "speaker": "SAMIRA",
      "locale": "fa-IR",
      "text": "درمانگاه باید به رسیدگی به مردم ادامه بده و مرکز خدمات باید آب و برق رو در جریان نگه داره. پناهگاه‌ها، جاده‌ها و نیروهای کارمون به هر دو وابسته‌ان. لیلا مسیر هوایی رو دنبال می‌کنه و دالیا وضعیت نظامی رو زیر نظر داره.",
      "voiceId": "7uxeJ73HfJL9gOH2mttA",
      "voiceName": "Warline - Engineer Samira Haddad",
      "assetPath": "Assets/Game/Audio/Narrative/CH05M01CitywideAlert/Voice/fa/citywide_alert-open-03.wav",
      "durationSeconds": 17.28,
      "sha256": "e50f6327c2d217ade6f8ae5de5740db612e59706da89302a4998f7af293309c5",
      "captionSha256": "878603766accca29e5a23dd1f1a46f77af5faf592690c0cd1d78458515180a05"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrative",
      "id": "citywide_alert-open-04",
      "speaker": "ARIA",
      "locale": "en-US",
      "text": "Confirmed threats are facts. Their likely next moves are predictions. My suggested responses are recommendations. I will keep those separate in the command picture, and no recommendation becomes an order without your approval.",
