      "kind": "narrative",
      "id": "citywide_alert-open-06",
      "speaker": "ARIA",
      "locale": "en-US",
      "text": "You retain approval over every action I propose. The first two fronts are the clinic and the utility site. Their priorities remain yours to direct; I will show the situation and wait for your decision.",
