      "id": "citywide_alert-open-07",
      "speaker": "DALIA",
      "locale": "en-US",
      "text": "We will protect these districts and keep command accountable. Hold both civic fronts, preserve the people keeping them alive, and prove that saving Sahrin does not require Qassem's permanent authority.",
