      "id": "citywide_alert-brief-01",
      "speaker": "SAMIRA",
      "locale": "en-US",
      "text": "The clinic and utility site protect different needs. Keep both intact. Clear each front's attackers, then bring an original engineer to its marked recovery point and hold for six seconds to restore service.",
