      "id": "citywide_alert-brief-03",
      "speaker": "ARIA",
      "locale": "en-US",
      "text": "I can request one Smoke screen on a marked lane. You decide whether to approve it. Approval covers that action alone; declining or continuing without it leaves command with you and consumes no Fuel.",
